hat the project had not previously made. **Falsifier**: produce a polylog K-policy whose hit rate at |error| ≤ 0.5 tends to a positive limit, or whose median |error| stays bounded, as x → ∞. Empirically falsified within tested range (x ≤ 3·10^6) but un-tested above. See experiments/analytic/connes_amortisation/connes_amortisation_results.md §"Slot 2 (S194) extension". | 194 |
    
